	(text "Population and use (references: first digit = detector k):\n- Differential probe on the pads Jk03: the 0R links Rk03 and Rk04 stay out (default).\n- SMA readout: fit Rk03 and Rk04. The 50 Ohm scope inputs short REF\n  (about 250 Ohm source), which costs about 6.6 dB at low IF.\n- Ck01 and Ck02: off-chip capacitor of the detector. With about 1.5 to 2 pF of\n  probe input and trace they make the 5 pF of the testbenches. Adjust to the probe.\n- Rk01 and Rk02 feed the DC monitor header."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 140.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9f723178-3d93-5612-9d19-bf47246722c9")
	)
